<section class="section section-pad" id="federation-limits" style="background:transparent;">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-kicker">Research motivation</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading">Challenges in federated PKI environments.</h2>
    <p class="section-sub" style="max-width:70ch;">
      Existing mechanisms such as cross-certification and bridge CAs have enabled interoperability
      for years. As trust topologies grow denser and cryptographic transitions more demanding, path
      discovery, governance, and route selection remain difficult to reason about in a formal,
      deterministic, crypto-aware way.
    </p>

